  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strgthen Glob Sth CSOs alliances to prmte</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is aimed at strengthening Global South civil society alliances to advocate for a just and equitable energy transition that respects human rights, protects the environment and alleviates the climate crisis in countries such as Ghana and Zimbabwe. It aims to develop knowledge and skills around transition minerals governance, to strengthen collaboration and engagement, and carry out joint advocacy. It will also work to enhance civil society&#x2019;s engagement in international and domestic initiatives and advocate to mitigate the negative impacts from the extraction of transition minerals on poor and marginalised communities.</narrative>
  </description>
